Keep it if: you collaborate with clients who use Slack or you manage a small team (2-5 people). Skip it if: you are a 100% solo freelancer (emails are enough) or your clients do not use Slack. As soon as you collaborate regularly with a team or clients who use Slack. Free alternative worth considering: discord.' WHERE slug = 'slack';
